  "task_id": 10142,
  "title": "What's normal anxiety -- and what's an anxiety disorder?",
  "author": "Jen Gunter",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/jen_gunter_what_s_normal_anxiety_and_what_s_an_anxiety_disorder",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T07:07:22.586444Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T07:07:22.586444Z",
  "lead_time": 46.795,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "We live in a culture that doesn't take mental health issues seriously.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E22C13DACD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "There's a lot of stigma.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0E6C0D1CCC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 41,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "or get it together, or to stop worrying, or that it's all in your head",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AF134D8C01",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 30,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "anxiety disorders, they're as real as diabetes",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7C3301EDB0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "(Music) [Body Stuff with Dr.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4699F0C570",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 11,
        "text": "Jen Gunter]",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "223CC2C756",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 8,
        "text": "Hi again.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6CCBA30D8F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "It's Dr.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6FD5971642",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "Jen, and I've noticed something with my patients.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6559DF23D3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "Constant worry, trouble sleeping, tense muscles and struggle with concentrating",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "90D5EE105C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "But they aren't getting treatment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0C488B6BED",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "There's a lot of issues with mental-health care in this country.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4530C84A09",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "Some people don't have insurance that would cover it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B6A09B67E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "Some have been dismissed or minimized in the past, and don't think seeking help will do any good.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4289777B3A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "Some worry about the stigma and whether it could affect future jobs or relationships.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EABFB3DA01",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "But severe anxiety isn't a moral or personal failing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E625260EE5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "It's a health problem, just like strep throat or diabetes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "72FFD09F75",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "It needs to be treated with the same kind of seriousness.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "356460DE2F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "Before we can talk about anxiety disorders, let's talk about anxiety itself.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "29D0A70C40",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "Anxiety is the very real and normal emotion we feel in a stressful situation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "021AEB552A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "It's related to fear.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0142A41F63",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 154,
        "text": "But while fear is a response to an immediate threat that quickly subsides, anxiety is a response to more uncertain threats that tends to last much longer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3EF6EB639C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "It's all part of the threat detection system, which all animals have to some degree, to help protect us from predators.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AA2B9FB817",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 146,
        "text": "Anxiety starts in the brain's amygdala, a pair of almond-sized nerve bundles that alert other areas of the brain to be ready for defensive action.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1DF2FE3BE5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "Next, the hypothalamus relays the signal, setting off what we call the stress response in our body.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F84BCFDDB3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "Our muscles tense, our breathing and heart rate increase and our blood pressure rises.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6E1B3B02B1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 36,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "put you in a state of high alertness.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AAAC8B9937",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "This is the fight-or-flight response.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5808E78E4F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 151,
        "text": "There are ways the fight-or-flight response is kept somewhat in check, with an area of higher-level thinking called the ventromedial prefrontal cortex.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4BA1058271",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "It works like this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E0531A1BB8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 111,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "it's time to run",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5BE86817F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 129,
        "text": "If a person sees something they think is dangerous, like a tiger, that sends a signal to the amygdala, saying \"it's time to run.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "61ADE34FB1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 61,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "Hey, look.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4EF7951CD1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "The ventromedial prefrontal cortex can say to the amygdala, \"Hey, look.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F64139A29C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "The tiger's in a cage.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "634AAD0776",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "You know what a cage is?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C0C43B6ED3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "You know what a cage is?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "466452EF7E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "They can't escape from a cage.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7EC439DF02",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "It's OK to calm down.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6444D8ACA5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "It's a feedback loop that can help keep the response in check.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E4A7DD0E0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "The hippocampus is also involved.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9255947817",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 42,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "Hey, we've seen tigers in cages before.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B5EDEEF9FE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "It provides context, saying things like, \"Hey, we've seen tigers in cages before.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "84457F332E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "We're in a zoo.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "338716B957",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "You are extra safe.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "899345D018",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "You are extra safe.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AF45731689",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 176,
        "text": "With anxiety, these threat-detection systems and mechanisms that reduce or inhibit them are functioning incorrectly and cause us to worry about the future and our safety in it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3CC5A728EB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "But for many people, it goes into overdrive.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D3F48CC27C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 151,
        "text": "They experience persistent pervasive anxiety that disrupts work, school and relationships and leads them to avoid situations that may trigger symptoms.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BF013A9B34",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "Anxiety disorders are not at all uncommon.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "35F9380BF1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 156,
        "text": "Based on data from the World Mental Health Survey, researchers estimate that about 16 percent of individuals currently have or have had an anxiety disorder.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4703A71053",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "These include social anxiety disorder, panic disorder, agoraphobia and phobias.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3D7F869AAC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "Studies have shown that people with anxiety disorders don't just have a different way of reacting to stress.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DE8A55EAA7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "There may be actual differences in how their brain is working.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D907A57664",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "One model describes possible mix-ups in the connections between the amygdala and other parts of the brain.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0255F7F88D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "The pathways that signal anxiety become stronger.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "44C46B46A7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "And the more anxiety you have, the stronger the pathways become, and it becomes a vicious cycle.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DA1B8241D9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 21,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "you have",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "96FCE1574F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "The good news is there's treatment for anxiety, and that you don't have to suffer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "39920F72BF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 57,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "you don't have to",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CD2870CFFC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "Remember, this isn't about weakness.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AAF9995B04",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 152,
        "text": "It's about changing brain patterns, and research shows that our brains have the ability to reorganize and form new connections all throughout our lives.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2B63BF3DFC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "A good first step is to do the basics.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0018E8917E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "Eat a balanced diet, exercise regularly and get plenty of sleep, as your mind is part of your body.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "81F8FDB592",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 68,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "your mind is part of your body",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "022A4E0E67",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "It might also help to try meditation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3761D2F670",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 171,
        "text": "Instead of our heart rate rising and our body tensing, with mindfulness and breathing, we can slow down the fight-or-flight response and improve how we feel in the moment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4DF8CB170E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "Cognitive behavioral therapy, a form of talk therapy, can also be fantastic.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "77E728D7BA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "In it, you learn",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "68D65DEE8A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "In it, you learn to identify upsetting thoughts and determine whether they're realistic.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BA5BA9867D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 44,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "rebuild those neural pathways",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "51D498DF04",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "Over time, cognitive behavioral therapy can rebuild those neural pathways that tamp down the anxiety response.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E2C843800B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "Medication can also give relief, in both the short-term and the long-term.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "454EDD8EDA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "In the short-term, anti-anxiety drugs can down-regulate the threat-detection mechanisms that are going into overdrive.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FFBCEA3A78",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 159,
        "text": "Studies have shown that both long-term medications and cognitive behavioral therapy can reduce that overreactivity of the amygdala we see an anxiety disorders.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5496CFB88",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "High blood pressure and diabetes, they can be treated or managed over time.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C14760881D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "And the same is true for an anxiety disorder too.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "36CBBCA46F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}